'''Suburbs of the Dead''' (亡者の住まう地 ''Mōja no'' ''Sumau Ji'', '''Homes of the Dead''') is the 34th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Difficulty depends on what units the player owns, especially [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombies]]. Without proper knowledge and strategy, this sub-chapter could be the start of a player's nightmare. However, since this sub-chapter was made in the same update with [[Zombie Outbreaks]], and thus most stages having Zombie enemies as the focus of the stage, this sub-chapter could be considered a lucky break for players that have had experience with outbreaks compared to earlier sub-chapters. The hardest stage is probably [[Revenant Road]] and the easiest is [[Home Sweet Mausoleum]] although [[Ghostlight Gardens]] can be an extremely tedious stage if you dont cheese it.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]  enemy type and all the Zombies that are present in [[Empire of Cats]]' [[Zombie Outbreaks]], excluding [[Miss Haka]].

