==Trivia==
*Each stage references a different horror work, although nearly all of them were lost in translation:
**[[Home Sweet Mausoleum]]'s Japanese name, Estate of Spirits = ''Spirit Estate'', a translation of [[wikipedia:The Conjuring|''The Conjuring'']]'s Japanese name
**[[Swamp of Sacrifice]] = ''Devil's Sacrifice'' and ''Devil's Swamp'', the translated Japanese names of the first two ''[[wikipedia:The Texas Chain Saw Massacre|Texas Chain Saw Massacre]]'' movies
**[[Dungeon of Dreams]]' Japanese name, Nightmare on Moor Street = ''[[wikipedia:A Nightmare on Elm Street|A Nightmare on Elm Street]]''
**[[Revenant Road]]'s Japanese name, Poltergei St. = ''[[wikipedia:Poltergeist (1982 film)|Poltergeist]]''
**[[Ghostlight Gardens]]' Japanese name, White Light Night = ''[[wikipedia:The Twilight Zone (1959 TV series)|The Twilight Zone]]''
**[[Silenced Meowing]]'s Japanese name, Silence of the Cats = ''[[wikipedia:The Silence of the Lambs (film)|The Silence of the Lambs]]''
***Later on in [[Uncanny Legends]], [[Theatre of Fear]] uses the same naming scheme, and to boot five of its six references still make sense in English.

